From 49b3919a7f32a88650f05e18a0d4d10e92432eaa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 12:30:22 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] Give the PlutoSDR configuration a second-chain role and
 an amplifier switch (#525)

PlutoConfig gains aux (the block a LimeSDR's second chain already uses, as
PlutoAuxConfig), pa_gpo (PlutoPaPin), pa_on and pa_active_low, plus the
pseudo-gain element names that drive them. The wire protocol moves to v166
because the radio configuration crosses whole.
