Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 12:30:22 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] PlutoSDR: RX2 as diversity or PureSignal feedback for the
 RX1 radio, and a PA bypass switch in the settings (#525)

The RX1 radio can borrow RX2 as a second aerial, combined by the shared
adaptive filter and driven from the main window's DIV strip, or as the
coupler PureSignal learns the amplifier from; PureSignal needs full duplex.
The Pluto settings gain an amplifier pin, an active-low option and a live
PA on/bypass switch. Documented in the manual's PlutoSDR section. Not yet
verified against hardware.
