From d22e61022fcab8794b1286fd9ace224532fdc905 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 13:50:35 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] PlutoSDR: switch the amplifier without reinitialising the
 AD9361 (#525)

adi,gpo-manual-mode-enable is stored straight into the driver's gpo_ctrl,
and gpo_set sets GPO_MANUAL_SELECT itself, so the amplifier pin needs only
those two writes, the same ones that work from the board's shell. Dropping
the initialize keeps the front end, and a sibling radio on the same
connection, undisturbed. The settings and the manual now say to power the
board from both USB ports with the amplifier in.
